{"title":"2023 SSMO Relay Round 5 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3051519cf5d47d7be8c47d37e1fa6414f43dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88feb67658b1aa5f66176d4c18f0a8580277a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\text{lcm} \\{1, 2, \\dots n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" /> for positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/330b3e663b7ac46c9d910dff55a19680607fe6cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^N a_i \\pmod {720}.\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"51\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023927\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansi